text = "Kiri the Fossil Finding Pup is a 2D simulation game where you play as a cute dog digging for dinosaur fossils while trying to identify and piece the fossils back together. Follow along, as you assist Kiri in uncovering ancient remains and learning about the Earth's past inhabitants. 

Developed by Team Dawg for the class COMP350: Videogame Development. 
Main Development Timeline: February 4, 2026 - April 30, 2026

Meet the Team!
Ella: Producer, Designer, Artist
Stephanie: Designer, Artist
Keith: Designer, Programmer
Mark: Designer, Programmer
Roamer: Scrum Master, Designer, Programmer, Artist"
